__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
plans/SESSIONS.md
.pytest_cache/
imgui.ini
.venv-lerobot/
# scripts/fix_jaw_collision.py's pristine copy of the converter output; the
# patched layer is what gets tracked, and --revert restores from this.
*.orig-convexhull

# Datasets and run outputs are too large to track, but the provenance that
# makes them traceable is not: ignore the trees, then negate the ledgers,
# manifests and reports back in. The directory negations are load-bearing --
# git will not descend into an excluded directory to find a re-included file.
# tests/test_gitignore_contract.py pins both halves of this contract.
datasets/raw/**
!datasets/raw/
!datasets/raw/*/
!datasets/raw/*/manifest.json
!datasets/raw/*/attempts.jsonl
runs/**
!runs/
!runs/**/
!runs/**/report.md
!runs/**/run.json
# The converted copy carries no provenance of its own -- it is a pure function
# of datasets/raw/<name>/ and scripts/convert_dataset.py, and the split it is
# trained on is recorded in the raw manifest -- so none of it is negated back
# in. tests/test_dataset_artifacts.py pins that, and that the tracked previews
# in media/ stay tracked.
datasets/lerobot/**
